@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.10
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:哪里不对了？|#0205Trial05_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:还是说，<br>你要否认你用了魔法吗？|#0205Trial05_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Downcast_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这、这个……|#0205Trial05_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……可是，<br>我并没有做什么<br>不正当的事！|#0205Trial05_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:在试镜或者和他人竞争的时候，<br>我并没有用魔法<br>争取有利地位……|#0205Trial05_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆自信なさげに

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Downcast_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"只不过是……<br>为了提升<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_05_01\">正式演出</link>的品质……<br>才用过……|#0205Trial05_Leia005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:绝、绝不是<br>为了除掉别人<br>才用的魔法！|#0205Trial05_Leia006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR9,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我是<br>为了<link=\"Objection_02_05_05_02\">来看我演出的观众</link>……<br>以及为了共同演出的同伴<br>才使用魔法的！|#0205Trial05_Leia007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR9,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"请相信我……！<br>不论是现在、过去、还是<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_05_03\">将来</link>……<br>我都不会做<br>那种卑鄙的事情！|#0205Trial05_Leia008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


